  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### **Predict & Trace**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Look at the JavaScript code in `script.js`. In the box below, write what you think will happen when you click the **Add Sunglight** button.\r\n\r\n2. Click the **Add Sunlight** button. Record what you observed in your **Unit Guide**.\r\n\r\n3. In your **Unit Guide**, annotate and label where the code:\r\n\r\n   * Selects an element\r\n   * Adds an event listener\r\n   * Reponds to the event\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": true,
      "solution": "When I click the Add Sunlight button, I think the page will show a message about the plant getting sunlight and the plant image will increase in size.",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "placeholderText": "When I click the \"Add Sunlight\" button, I think the page will change by…",
